OL,3,ATate brothers to remain in US jail as
OL,4,Athey fight extradition to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew and Tristan Tate have lost their
OL,7,Fbid to be released from a Florida jail
OL,8,Fas they fight potential extradition to
OL,9,Fthe UK to face charges of rape and
OL,10,Ftrafficking.
OL,12,FA federal judge in Miami denied them
OL,13,Fbail, saying the dual US-UK citizens'
OL,14,Fwealth and frequent international
OL,15,Ftravel "constitute quintessential
OL,16,Fflight risks".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
